{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "routing/a-room-that-heard-another-sender-long-ago-is-not-the-sender-s",
  "title": "Under the lock, a room that heard another sender on the channel, however long ago, is no longer a routed sender's: the message gets a room of its own",
  "rules": [
    "§10.1 step 2",
    "§10.4"
  ],
  "notes": "The router answers room-1 for every message. Bob wrote on sms into room-1 by name, which records no one, then 55 messages came on ws. Alice's routed message finds the binding naming no one, but the room heard Bob on sms: the check under the lock reads the channel's whole history, as the router's step 3 does, so room-1 is not hers. Routed again to room-1, the second answer is not hers either, and she gets a new room.",
